      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Consumer**\n\nI'm focusing on crafting a Python script, `consume_event.py`, that retrieves a single message from either a managed subscription or a queue. I've selected Google Cloud Pub/Sub as the external provider, making it the focal point for this specific implementation.\n\n\n**Developing the Consumer Script**\n\nI'm now creating the `consume_event.py` file and beginning the implementation for consuming a message from a Google Cloud Pub/Sub subscription. I'm focusing on incorporating the relevant provider-specific identifiers. I'll need to use `google.cloud.pubsub_v1` and the `subscriber.subscribe` constructs to successfully interact with the service.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859596483,
          "start": 1789859594486
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf200f6001TWhgb1FZBZUnVM",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbf1fc97001AXKxalYzm5AHqn",
      "session_id": "ses_f440e037cffeGHXcvzoeUVrO8O",
      "time_created": 1789859594487,
      "time_updated": 1789859596484
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "PpO9NtLHT4WKqIJT",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "\nfrom google.cloud import pubsub_v1\nimport os\n\ndef consume_event(project_id: str, subscription_id: str, timeout: float = 5.0):\n    \"\"\"Consumes one message from a Google Cloud Pub/Sub subscription.\"\"\"\n    subscriber = pubsub_v1.SubscriberClient()\n    subscription_path = subscriber.subscription_path(project_id, subscription_id)\n\n    def callback(message: pubsub_v1.subscriber.message.Message):\n        print(f\"Received message: {message.data.decode(\"utf-8\")}\")\n        message.ack()\n\n    streaming_pull_future = subscriber.subscribe(subscription_path, callback=callback)\n    print(f\"Listening for messages on {subscription_path}...\")\n\n    try:\n        streaming_pull_future.result(timeout=timeout)\n    except TimeoutError:\n        streaming_pull_future.cancel()\n        streaming_pull_future.result()\n        print(\"No messages received within the timeout period.\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Listening for messages on {subscription_path} threw an exception: {e}.\")\n\n    subscriber.close()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Replace with your Google Cloud Project ID and Subscription ID\n    project_id = os.environ.get(\"GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT\")\n    subscription_id = os.environ.get(\"GOOGLE_CLOUD_PUBSUB_SUBSCRIPTION_ID\")\n\n    if not project_id or not subscription_id:\n        print(\"Please set GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT and GOOGLE_CLOUD_PUBSUB_SUBSCRIPTION_ID environment variables.\")\n    else:\n        consume_event(project_id, subscription_id)\n",
            "filePath": "consume_event.py"
          },
